<p>Russian President Vladimir Putin met Cuban Foreign Minister Bruno Rodriguez Parrilla in the Kremlin on Wednesday, using the visit to reaffirm Moscow’s ties with Havana and criticize recent US measures targeting Cuba’s economy. Russian state media also quoted Putin as pointing to the countries’ long relationship and Russia’s support for Cuba’s right to choose its own path. The meeting comes as Cuba grapples with a severe energy crunch, with fuel shortages and blackouts that RT links to tightened US pressure and limits on oil supplies.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Energy lifeline: Russia’s embassy in Havana said Moscow is preparing a delivery of oil and petroleum products to Cuba as the island grapples with fuel scarcity.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Russian government: Putin told Rodriguez the latest US restrictions on Cuba are “unacceptable” and said Russia would not accept such measures against Havana. (<a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/02/19/putin-tells-cuban-fm-russia-will-not-accept-recent-us-sanctions-against-havana'>Euronews</a>)</li><li>Cuban government: Rodriguez thanked Russia for its “extraordinary and unwavering solidarity” and support during difficult conditions, according to the Kremlin. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/632750-putin-cuba-meeting-kremlin/'>RT</a>)</li><li>United States (White House): The White House said it wants “dramatic changes very soon” in Cuba and called the Cuban government “failing.” (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/18/russias-putin-meets-cuban-fm-says-us-restrictions-unacceptable'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/632750-putin-cuba-meeting-kremlin/'>Putin meets top Cuban diplomat amid US blockade</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/putin-meets-cuban-foreign-minister-in-moscow-says-us-restrictions-are-unacceptable'>Putin meets Cuban foreign minister in Moscow, says US restrictions are ‘unacceptable’</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/02/19/putin-tells-cuban-fm-russia-will-not-accept-recent-us-sanctions-against-havana'>Putin tells Cuban FM Russia will not accept recent US sanctions against Havana</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/18/russias-putin-meets-cuban-fm-says-us-restrictions-unacceptable'>Russia’s Putin meets Cuban FM, says US restrictions ‘unacceptable’</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/putin-meets-cuban-fm-in-moscow-calls-new-us-restrictions-unacceptable-13981382.html'>Putin meets Cuban FM in Moscow, calls new US restrictions &#x27;unacceptable&#x27;</a> - firstpost.com</li></ul>